  "main_html": "<section class=\"hero training-marker\" data-training-page=\"true\" style=\"background:#fff3cd;border:3px solid #d97706;border-radius:18px;padding:20px;margin-bottom:20px\"><p class=\"kicker\">TRAINING PAGE</p><h1 style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0\">Training page</h1><p><strong>Sandbox only.</strong> Not a production or sponsor-facing page.</p><p class=\"muted\">This page is copied from the real canonical pack and marked as training.</p></section>\n<section class=\"hero\">\n  <p class=\"kicker\">The Dentistry Guides \u00b7 Independent educational publisher</p>\n  <h1>The Dentistry Guides</h1>\n  <p class=\"muted\">The Dentistry Guides publishes high-signal, no-hype frameworks for dentistry decisions like implants, full-arch care, veneers, sedation, and oral surgery.</p>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section conversion-cta conversion-cta--primary\" data-primary-conversion-cta=\"true\">\n  <div class=\"conversion-cta__panel conversion-cta__panel--primary\">\n    <p class=\"conversion-cta__eyebrow\">Start here</p>\n    <h2 class=\"conversion-cta__heading\">View your next steps</h2>\n    <p class=\"conversion-cta__body\">Use the dedicated next-steps path after you review the homepage short answer, provider preview, and state routing.</p>\n    <p class=\"conversion-cta__actions\">\n      <a class=\"button button-primary conversion-cta__button\" href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/next-steps/?src=%2F&amp;intent=decision_hub&amp;button=next_steps_cta&amp;vertical=dentistry&amp;page_kind=global&amp;page_slug=home\" data-provider-type=\"Dentist (Cosmetic, Implant, or General Care)\" data-page-src=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/\" data-button-source=\"next_steps_cta\" data-intent-type=\"decision_hub\" data-market-slug=\"\" data-page-kind=\"global\" data-vertical-key=\"dentistry\">View Your Next Steps</a>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"callout answer-block\" data-home-answer=\"true\" data-short-answer=\"true\">\n  <h2>Short answer</h2>\n  <p>The Dentistry Guides is a neutral resource that helps people compare treatment fit, pricing clarity, trust signals, and specialist-versus-generalist care before they choose a provider. It is most useful when a city page feels too broad, but you still need to compare what matters most before booking. The Dentistry Guides does not recommend specific dentists; instead, it explains which differences matter most before you move into local comparison.</p>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" data-home-about-block=\"true\">\n  <h2>About The Dentistry Guides</h2>\n  <p>The Dentistry Guides exists to explain what people usually compare before choosing a dentist: cost, treatment plan clarity, credentials, follow-up expectations, and written questions to ask.</p>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section provider-directory-section provider-directory-section--preview\" data-provider-directory=\"true\" data-home-provider-preview=\"true\"><h2>Examples of providers</h2><p class=\"muted\">These are neutral, non-ranked examples of dental providers so the homepage feels concrete before you narrow into a state or city page.</p><div class=\"provider-directory-grid\"><article class=\"provider-card\" data-provider-card=\"true\"><h3 class=\"provider-card__name\">Brennan Dental</h3><p class=\"provider-card__meta\" data-provider-card-meta=\"true\">Dental provider \u2014 Chandler, AZ</p><ul class=\"provider-card__attributes\" data-provider-card-attributes=\"true\"><li>Compare treatment scope, written plan clarity, and follow-up expectations</li><li>Verify dental licensing through the official state resource</li></ul></article><article class=\"provider-card\" data-provider-card=\"true\"><h3 class=\"provider-card__name\">Chandler Dental</h3><p class=\"provider-card__meta\" data-provider-card-meta=\"true\">Dental provider \u2014 Chandler, AZ</p><ul class=\"provider-card__attributes\" data-provider-card-attributes=\"true\"><li>Compare treatment scope, written plan clarity, and follow-up expectations</li><li>Verify dental licensing through the official state resource</li></ul></article><article class=\"provider-card\" data-provider-card=\"true\"><h3 class=\"provider-card__name\">Smiles of Chandler</h3><p class=\"provider-card__meta\" data-provider-card-meta=\"true\">Dental provider \u2014 Chandler, AZ</p><ul class=\"provider-card__attributes\" data-provider-card-attributes=\"true\"><li>Compare treatment scope, written plan clarity, and follow-up expectations</li><li>Verify dental licensing through the official state resource</li></ul></article><article class=\"provider-card\" data-provider-card=\"true\"><h3 class=\"provider-card__name\">Arizona Dental Health Inc.</h3><p class=\"provider-card__meta\" data-provider-card-meta=\"true\">Dental provider \u2014 Mesa, AZ</p><ul class=\"provider-card__attributes\" data-provider-card-attributes=\"true\"><li>Compare treatment scope, written plan clarity, and follow-up expectations</li><li>Verify dental licensing through the official state resource</li></ul></article></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section faq-entry-card\" data-home-faq-entry=\"true\"><h2>Need quick answers first?</h2><p class=\"muted\">Use the FAQ when you want definitions, costs, timing questions, and fast clarification before you open a state page.</p><p class=\"actions\"><a class=\"button button-secondary\" href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/faq/\">Open the FAQ for The Dentistry Guides</a></p></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" data-home-state-grid-shell=\"true\">\n  <h2>Browse by state</h2>\n  <p class=\"muted\">Start with your state to narrow into city pages, provider examples, and licensing resources.</p>\n  <div class=\"state-card-grid\" data-home-state-grid=\"true\"><div class=\"grid\" data-markets-status-list=\"states\"><div class=\"card\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0\"><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/states/AZ/\">Arizona</a></h3><p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin:0\">State hub</p></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0\"><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/states/CA/\">California</a></h3><p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin:0\">State hub</p></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0\"><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/states/CO/\">Colorado</a></h3><p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin:0\">State hub</p></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0\"><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/states/FL/\">Florida</a></h3><p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin:0\">State hub</p></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0\"><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/states/GA/\">Georgia</a></h3><p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin:0\">State hub</p></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0\"><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/states/IL/\">Illinois</a></h3><p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin:0\">State hub</p></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0\"><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/states/IN/\">Indiana</a></h3><p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin:0\">State hub</p></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0\"><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/states/KS/\">Kansas</a></h3><p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin:0\">State hub</p></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0\"><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/states/MI/\">Michigan</a></h3><p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin:0\">State hub</p></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0\"><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/states/NY/\">New York</a></h3><p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin:0\">State hub</p></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0\"><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/states/NC/\">North Carolina</a></h3><p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin:0\">State hub</p></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0\"><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/states/OH/\">Ohio</a></h3><p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin:0\">State hub</p></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0\"><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/states/PA/\">Pennsylvania</a></h3><p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin:0\">State hub</p></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0\"><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/states/TN/\">Tennessee</a></h3><p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin:0\">State hub</p></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0\"><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/states/TX/\">Texas</a></h3><p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin:0\">State hub</p></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0\"><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/states/VA/\">Virginia</a></h3><p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin:0\">State hub</p></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0\"><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/states/WA/\">Washington</a></h3><p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin:0\">State hub</p></div></div></div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section conversion-cta conversion-cta--inline\" data-inline-conversion-cta=\"true\">\n  <div class=\"conversion-cta__panel conversion-cta__panel--inline\">\n    <p class=\"conversion-cta__eyebrow\">Need help now?</p>\n    <h2 class=\"conversion-cta__heading\">Get matched with a provider</h2>\n    <p class=\"conversion-cta__body\">This site is educational first, but you can still use the callback path after you narrow into the right state, city, or guide.</p>\n    <p class=\"conversion-cta__actions\">\n      <a class=\"button button-primary conversion-cta__button\" href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/request-assistance/?pt=Dentist%20(Cosmetic%2C%20Implant%2C%20or%20General%20Care)&amp;src=%2F&amp;intent=direct_match&amp;button=primary_cta&amp;vertical=dentistry&amp;page_kind=global&amp;page_slug=home\" data-provider-type=\"Dentist (Cosmetic, Implant, or General Care)\" data-page-src=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/\" data-button-source=\"primary_cta\" data-intent-type=\"direct_match\" data-market-slug=\"\" data-page-kind=\"global\" data-vertical-key=\"dentistry\">Get Matched With a Provider</a>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section tertiary-support\" data-tertiary-support=\"true\">\n  <h2>Need a lighter support path?</h2>\n  <p class=\"muted\">Use the FAQ, methodology, or guides hub when you still need definitions before opening a state page.</p>\n  <p class=\"muted support-links\"><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/faq/\">FAQ</a> \u00b7 <a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/methodology/\">Methodology</a> \u00b7 <a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/guides/\">Guides hub</a></p>\n</section>\n\n<details class=\"section fanout-query-cluster fanout-query-cluster--tertiary accordion\" data-fanout-query-cluster=\"true\"><summary><span>Related search paths</span><span class=\"accordion-meta\">Additional owned routes for this topic</span></summary><div class=\"accordion-panel\"><p class=\"muted\">These routes support fanout/query coverage and keep owned paths visible, but they are intentionally secondary to the main framework and next-step flow.</p><div class=\"fanout-query-group\" id=\"primary\"><h3>Core discovery paths</h3><ul class=\"fanout-query-list\"><li class=\"fanout-query-item\"><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/\"><strong>dentist near me</strong></a><span class=\"fanout-query-path\"> \u2192 Home</span></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"fanout-query-group\" id=\"compare\"><h3>Core discovery paths</h3><ul class=\"fanout-query-list\"><li class=\"fanout-query-item\"><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/guides/how-to-choose/\"><strong>how to choose a dentist</strong></a><span class=\"fanout-query-path\"> \u2192 How to choose</span></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"fanout-query-group\" id=\"costs\"><h3>Core discovery paths</h3><ul class=\"fanout-query-list\"><li class=\"fanout-query-item\"><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/guides/dental-implants/\"><strong>dental implants cost and recovery</strong></a><span class=\"fanout-query-path\"> \u2192 Dental implants</span></li>\n<li class=\"fanout-query-item\"><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/guides/veneers/\"><strong>veneers vs crowns cost and fit</strong></a><span class=\"fanout-query-path\"> \u2192 Veneers</span></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"fanout-query-group\" id=\"faq\"><h3>Core discovery paths</h3><ul class=\"fanout-query-list\"><li class=\"fanout-query-item\"><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/guides/dental-red-flags/\"><strong>dental treatment red flags</strong></a><span class=\"fanout-query-path\"> \u2192 Dental red flags</span></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"fanout-query-group\" id=\"next\"><h3>Core discovery paths</h3><ul class=\"fanout-query-list\"><li class=\"fanout-query-item\"><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/guides/questions-to-ask/\"><strong>questions to ask before major dental work</strong></a><span class=\"fanout-query-path\"> \u2192 Questions to ask</span></li></ul></div></div></details>\n\n<section class=\"section\">\n  <h2>Start with the frameworks</h2>\n  <div class=\"grid\">\n    <div class=\"card\"><h3><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/guides/\">Guides hub</a></h3><p>Implants, full-arch, veneers, sedation, oral surgery, costs, and how to compare written plans.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><h3><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/guides/how-to-choose/\">How to choose</a></h3><p>Start here when you need a scannable checklist for comparing dentist type, treatment clarity, trust signals, and written pricing before you book.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><h3><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/guides/dental-red-flags/\">Red flags</a></h3><p>Use this when a plan feels rushed, vague, or overly sales-driven.</